usage: evaluate.py [-h] --config CONFIG [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT]
                   [--model MODEL] [--device DEVICE] [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]
                   [--tasks TASKS] [--set KEY=VALUE] [--verbose]
                   [--no-progress]

Evaluate an FP or fake-quant checkpoint.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       Base recipe config.
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
                        Optional torch checkpoint to evaluate.
  --model MODEL         Override model.name_or_path.
  --device DEVICE       Override runtime.device.
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        Write evaluation_protocol.json here.
  --tasks TASKS         Comma-separated top-level evaluation targets. When
                        set, only these targets run; benchmark details remain
                        in the config.
  --set KEY=VALUE
  --verbose             Print detailed evaluation sample logs.
  --no-progress         Disable tqdm/progress bars.
